Package: com.dsh.reverse-resident
Name: DSH Reverse Resident
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: The device half of the DeepSeek Harness reverse-engineering capability. A SpringBoard tweak that listens on /var/mobile/Library/DSHReverse/rvd.sock and serves process, image, symbol, Mach-O, and memory operations to the harness over NDJSON frames.
Maintainer: local
Author: local
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate